sequenceDiagram
    participant User
    participant App
    participant LLM
    participant DB
    participant Matching

    User->>App: Submit raw profile
    App->>LLM: Extract structured data + generate embeddings
    LLM->>DB: Save structured data & embeddings
    User->>App: Perform swipe actions
    App->>DB: Record swipe + update preferences
    loop Daily batch
        DB->>Matching: Feed preferences
        Matching->>Matching: Run Gale-Shapley
        Matching->>DB: Update stable matches
    end
    DB->>LangChain: Retrieve context
    LangChain->>RAG: Generate suggestions
    RAG->>User: Show recommendations